BEHAVIOR handle-error

DESCRIPTION
  Prints error message to console based on error code.
  Maps system error codes to human-readable messages.

CONTRACT
  INPUT error_code int 8
  OUTPUT printed int 8

  REQUIRES println@a273ebb3 error-messages-get@d183f477

  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 2e4feec0

COMPOSITION
  # Get error message for code (a self-describing string)
  message = CALL error-messages-get error_code
  CALL println message.text
  SET printed 1
END
